   "RaceName": "District Court No. 7",
   "Statement": "<b>Occupation<br></b>Deputy Prosecuting Attorney; Legal Advisor to Pierce County District Court; Thurston County District Court Pro Tem Judge<br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Education<br></b>Willamette University College of Law; Whitman College<br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Statement</b>&nbsp;<br>Mike Sommerfeld is the only&nbsp;<i>“Exceptionally Well Qualified\"</i>&nbsp;candidate, the highest rating from the Tacoma-Pierce County Bar Association, and the only one endorsed by&nbsp;<i>both the Democratic and Republican</i>&nbsp;<i>Parties,</i>&nbsp;and by a&nbsp;<i>majority of Pierce County Judges</i>.</p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">He has the deep legal knowledge and balanced experience to excel as Judge. As a deputy prosecutor for 30 years, Mike prosecuted misdemeanors, domestic violence, kidnapping, child sexual abuse, and murder. He’s a trusted legal advisor to Pierce County District Court, helping judges navigate complex legal and constitutional issues. As a Pro Tem Judge, he’s presided over criminal and civil cases.</p><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Mike will hold violent offenders accountable while expanding therapeutic and alternative programs that reduce repeat offenses. Outside courtrooms, he’s volunteered with foster youth programs, veterans’ legal clinics, and served on the Brady Committee, ensuring law enforcement upholds the highest standards. Please vote for Mike Sommerfeld, the consensus choice for judge.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></p><p> ",
